<title>USA: U.S to sell $18 billion of 48-day bills July 31.</title>
<headline>U.S to sell $18 billion of 48-day bills July 31.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Department said on Tuesday it will auction $18 billion of 48-day cash management bills on July 31.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued on August 1 and mature on September 18.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the 48-day cash management bills is 9127942U7.</p>
